[nomarkup][It doesn't take a rocket scientist to notice a rip in the wall where phone cable should be. It's most likely Dominic who's responsible or someone who works for him. You can feel the urge to call Arthur, ask him to come over and stay with you - but you couldn't even if you wanted to.][/nomarkup] #line:0600fec 
<<if GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Technology")==1>>
    -> [nomarkup][Try to fix it.][/nomarkup]
    <<jump phoneInt1>>
<<elseif GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Technology")==2 and GetHasItem("IT_Q_DUCTTAPE")==true>>
    -> [nomarkup][Try to fix it with the tape.][/nomarkup]
    <<jump phoneInt2Duct>>
<<elseif GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Technology")==2>>
    -> [nomarkup][Try to fix it.][/nomarkup]
    <<jump phoneInt2>>
<<elseif GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Technology")>=3 and GetHasItem("IT_Q_DUCTTAPE")==true>>
    -> [nomarkup][Try to fix it with the tape.][/nomarkup]
    <<jump phoneInt3Duct>>
<<elseif GetAttributeSkillPoolSize("Intelligence","Technology")>=3>>
    -> [nomarkup][Try to fix it.][/nomarkup]
    <<jump phoneInt2>>
<<endif>>
-> [nomarkup][Leave the phone alone.][/nomarkup]
